{"v":3,"catch":"數秒起飛。永恆探索。","desc":"數秒起飛——終生掌握蒼穹。簡易飛行模擬器2融合即玩即上手的操控與驚人精準的飛行動力學。從四款獨特機型中挑選，探索十二張動態天氣手繪地圖，並透過每次遊玩皆會演變的AI生成關卡，體驗永不重複的飛行旅程。\n\n無論是在夕陽下掠過海岸線，或雨天穿梭山谷間，駕駛艙永遠為您敞開。\n\n無需操作手冊。","publisher":"Pix Arts","release":"2025-11-06","genres":["競速"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6321e22748de24b78f51c1813e53214a1f20f01468f0215e1bf2d2bfe2e87082.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/59c1ccc0feb39426ce04622d237d47519c61440adda80d8853f8fd49112f9e12.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5a002b32b17ad95df875f4a842c9b31725262a4bb215b20d1f207fca0208ce04.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a887a6d959c6ee403553e75bb00f7ad352d05d53935aeb337e22aec85c3f8c0d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/70799db6eda1e06eb749ef3c35a3ff337c49ba503fec6ddd3cf2a70797e08287.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b213cf0c59849fd2cbbd0ab319d30bdf71925f720875ef135cc6ded6a8f44bf.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e27025d18000","dlc":[]}